// ================= SÉRIE "30 DIAS PRESO NO AEROPORTO" — PARTE 1 =================
for (const n of ['portao', 'portaoEscuro', 'praca', 'saguao', 'pista', 'metro', 'velorio', 'ruaCidade']) { if (BGIMG[n]) continue; BG_NAMES.push(n); const im = document.createElement('img'); im.src = 'bg/' + n + '.png'; im.style.cssText = 'position:absolute;left:-192px;top:-108px;width:2304px;height:1296px;display:none;filter:blur(1.1px) saturate(1.12)'; BGI.appendChild(im); BGIMG[n] = im; }
const JORGE = xt({ skin: '#C88F66', shirt: '#26324A', inner: '#DDE3EA', stripe: '#F2B636', hair: 'buzz', hairCol: '#1B1716', stubble: true, iris: '#3A2A1A', legX: 75 });
const CIDA = xt({ skin: '#EAC9AC', shirt: '#D9A43A', inner: '#F4EAD8', stripe: '#B5842A', hair: 'curly', hairCol: '#F2F0F4', old: true, iris: '#3A5A6A', skirt: '#6E2A3A', pants: '#EAC9AC', earring: '#F4F1EA', legX: 30 });
const LIA = xt({ skin: '#D9A47A', shirt: '#E04B3C', hair: 'pony', hairCol: '#2A1C14', iris: '#4A3A2A', skirt: '#2C3E66', pants: '#D9A47A', hs: 1.22, legX: 0, torsoX: 0 });
const MARCOS = xt({ skin: '#F1C7A0', shirt: '#3E9B4A', hair: 'side', hairCol: '#8A3A22', stubble: true, iris: '#3A5A3A' });
const PAX = [xt({ skin: '#8A5A3A', shirt: '#7A5AC8', hair: 'afro', hairCol: '#1B1716', iris: '#3A2A1A' }), xt({ skin: '#F5D2B0', shirt: '#C2577A', hair: 'wavy', hairCol: '#C7782E', iris: '#3A6A8A', skirt: '#2E3442', pants: '#F5D2B0' }), xt({ skin: '#E8B98F', shirt: '#5A6070', hair: 'short', hairCol: '#9A948E', old: true, iris: '#4A4A4A' }), xt({ skin: '#C88F66', shirt: '#2C6F5A', hair: 'bob', hairCol: '#1B1716', iris: '#5A3A22', earring: '#E0B13A', skirt: '#3A3F4B', pants: '#C88F66' }), xt({ skin: '#F1C7A0', shirt: '#E07B2E', hair: 'spiky', hairCol: '#2A211C', iris: '#3A4A6A' }), xt({ skin: '#D9A47A', shirt: '#3F86CF', hair: 'buzz', hairCol: '#2A211C', iris: '#3A2A1A', stubble: true })];
const AGE = 25;
const NEOS = (o) => NEOp(AGE, Object.assign({ s: 0.92 }, o));
const wg = (L, re, n = 0) => { const ws = TL.lines[L].words; let c = 0; for (const w of ws) if (re.test(w.text.toLowerCase())) { if (c === n) return w.start; c++; } return TL.lines[L].start; };
const at = (L, re, n = 0, pre = 0.25) => wg(L, re, n) - TL.lines[L].start - pre;
// ---------- HUD: dia + hora
const DAYS = [[3, '1'], [9, '2'], [14, '3'], [18, '4'], [24, '5'], [32, '6'], [36, '7'], [41, '8'], [46, '9'], [49, '10'], [55, '11'], [62, '12']];
function dayLbl(T) { let d = ''; for (const [L, v] of DAYS) if (T >= TL.lines[L].start - 0.15) d = v; return d; }
const HORAS = { 21: '18:00', 29: '02:40', 30: '02:41', 36: '15:00', 55: '04:02', 62: '03:17', 63: '03:17', 64: '03:18', 65: '03:19', 66: '03:21', 67: '03:21', 68: '03:22', 69: '03:22', 70: '03:22' };
function levelHud(i, t) {
  if (i < 3 || i > 70) return '';
  const d = dayLbl(t); let g = '';
  if (d) g += G('translate(70,62)', R(0, 0, 210, 74, 26, '#1A1210', 6) + T(105, 49, `DIA ${d}`, 44, '#FFFFFF'));
  if (HORAS[i]) g += G('translate(296,62)', R(0, 0, 190, 74, 26, '#C62A2A', 6) + T(95, 49, HORAS[i], 42, '#FFFFFF'));
  return g;
}
// ---------- efeitos de clima / terror
function fog(t, a = 0.85, y0 = 0, h = 1080, seed = 2) { const id = 'fg' + (ZID++); let g = `<defs><radialGradient id="${id}"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#F4F7F9" stop-opacity="${a}"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#F4F7F9" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>`; const r = rng(seed); for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) { const x = ((r() * 2400 + t * (20 + r() * 30)) % 2600) - 340, y = y0 + r() * h; g += E(x, y, 380 + r() * 260, 160 + r() * 120, `url(#${id})`, 0); } return g; }
const vig = (a = 0.6) => { const id = 'vg' + (ZID++); return `<defs><radialGradient id="${id}" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="70%"><stop offset="0.45" stop-color="#05060A" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#05060A" stop-opacity="${a}"/></radialGradient></defs>` + R(-200, -200, 2320, 1480, 0, `url(#${id})`, 0); };
const flick = (t, a = 0.5) => (Math.sin(t * 37) > 0.93 || Math.sin(t * 23 + 1) > 0.97) ? R(-200, -200, 2320, 1480, 0, `rgba(5,6,10,${a})`, 0) : '';
function shadowFig(x, y, s, a) { return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, `<g opacity="${a}">` + E(0, -560, 70, 90, '#2A3040', 0) + P('M-90,-470 Q-110,-200 -70,0 L70,0 Q110,-200 90,-470 Q0,-500 -90,-470Z', '#2A3040', 0) + P('M-90,-450 L-150,-180 M90,-450 L150,-180', 'none', 0) + Ln(-90, -440, -140, -160, '#2A3040', 34) + Ln(90, -440, 140, -160, '#2A3040', 34) + '</g>'); }
function handPrint(x, y, s, a = 1) { return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, `<g opacity="${a}" fill="rgba(70,80,96,0.55)">` + E(0, 40, 70, 80, 'rgba(70,80,96,0.55)', 0) + [[-62, -70, -14], [-24, -110, -4], [16, -116, 4], [54, -96, 12], [86, 10, 40]].map(([fx, fy, r]) => G(`rotate(${r} ${fx} ${fy + 50})`, E(fx, fy, 18, 52, 'rgba(70,80,96,0.55)', 0))).join('') + '</g>'); }
function board(x, y, s, rows, t, off = false) { let g = R(-420, -260, 840, 520, 20, '#141A28', 8) + R(-420, -260, 840, 70, 20, '#F2B636', 0) + T(0, -212, 'PARTIDAS', 40, '#1A1210'); if (!off) rows.forEach((r, i) => { const k = r[3] === undefined ? 1 : r[3]; if (k <= 0) return; g += `<g opacity="${k}">` + T(-300, -130 + i * 72, r[0], 34, '#DDE3EA') + T(-80, -130 + i * 72, r[1], 34, '#DDE3EA') + T(240, -130 + i * 72, r[2], 34, r[2] === 'CHEGOU' ? '#5BE38A' : '#FF4A4A') + '</g>'; }); else g += R(-400, -180, 800, 420, 10, '#0A0D14', 0); return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, g); }
function phoneChat(x, y, s, t, msgs, title = 'MÃE', bars = 0) { let g = R(-180, -330, 360, 660, 44, '#1A1A20', 8) + R(-160, -300, 320, 600, 26, '#ECE5DD', 0) + R(-160, -300, 320, 80, 26, '#2E7D5A', 0) + C(-110, -260, 26, '#F4F1EA', 0) + T(-110, -250, title[0], 30, '#2E7D5A') + T(10, -250, title, 30, '#FFFFFF');
  for (let b = 0; b < 4; b++) g += R(100 + b * 14, -248 - b * 7, 9, 10 + b * 7, 2, b < bars ? '#FFFFFF' : 'rgba(255,255,255,0.3)', 0);
  msgs.forEach((m, i) => { const k = m.k === undefined ? 1 : m.k; if (k <= 0) return; const me = !m.in, yy = -170 + i * 92; g += G(`translate(0,${yy}) scale(${k})`, R(me ? -60 : -150, -34, 210, 68, 18, me ? '#DCF8C6' : '#FFFFFF', 4) + C(me ? -26 : -116, 0, 16, me ? '#2E7D5A' : '#2C6FB6', 0) + P(me ? 'M-31,-8 L-18,0 L-31,8Z' : 'M-121,-8 L-108,0 L-121,8Z', '#FFFFFF', 0) + Ln(me ? 0 : -90, 0, me ? 110 : 20, 0, '#9AA6B8', 5) + (me ? (m.sent ? T(130, 24, '✓✓', 18, '#3F86CF') : G('translate(132,16)', C(0, 0, 9, 'none', 3) + Ln(0, 0, 0, -6, O, 3) + Ln(0, 0, 4, 2, O, 3))) : '')); });
  return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, g); }
function rulesBoard(x, y, s, t, ks) { let g = R(-380, -300, 760, 600, 16, '#FFFFFF', 8) + R(-380, -300, 760, 80, 16, '#C62A2A', 0) + T(0, -246, 'REGRAS', 50, '#FFFFFF'); ['1. COMIDA DIVIDIDA IGUAL', '2. LUZES APAGAM ÀS 22H', '3. NINGUÉM SAI PELA PORTA'].forEach((l, i) => { const k = ks[i]; if (k > 0) g += `<g opacity="${k}">` + T(0, -120 + i * 130, l, 40, i === 2 ? '#C62A2A' : '#1A1210') + '</g>'; }); return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s}) rotate(-2)`, g); }
function notebook(x, y, s, t, erased = 0) { let g = R(-360, -260, 720, 520, 14, '#FFF8E6', 8) + Ln(0, -260, 0, 260, 'rgba(120,90,60,0.4)', 6); for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) { const cx = (i % 4) * 160 - 270 + (i % 4 > 1 ? 40 : 0), cy = Math.floor(i / 4) * 230 - 90; const gone = i < erased; g += `<g opacity="${gone ? 0.12 : 1}">` + C(cx, cy - 50, 30, 'none', 6) + Ln(cx, cy - 20, cx, cy + 50, O, 6) + Ln(cx - 36, cy + 5, cx + 36, cy + 5, O, 6) + Ln(cx, cy + 50, cx - 26, cy + 100, O, 6) + Ln(cx, cy + 50, cx + 26, cy + 100, O, 6) + '</g>'; if (gone) g += rp(`M${cx - 50},${cy - 60} q30,40 60,10 t60,30`, 'rgba(150,140,130,0.35)', 22); } return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s}) rotate(-3)`, g); }
function paperBoat(x, y, s) { return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, P('M-90,0 L90,0 L60,40 L-60,40Z', '#F4F7FA', 6) + P('M-30,0 L0,-80 L30,0Z', '#DDE6F0', 6) + T(0, 26, 'GATE 12', 14, '#5A6070')); }
function rope(x1, y1, x2, y2, t, cut = false) { const mx = (x1 + x2) / 2, my = (y1 + y2) / 2 + 60 + Math.sin(t * 3) * 10; return rp(`M${x1},${y1} Q${mx},${my} ${x2},${y2}`, '#8A5A33', 16) + rp(`M${x1},${y1} Q${mx},${my} ${x2},${y2}`, '#C9A06A', 10) + (cut ? G(`translate(${x2},${y2})`, rp('M0,0 l14,-10 l-4,14 l16,-4 l-12,14', '#C9A06A', 6)) : ''); }
function glassDoor(x, y, s, open = 0) { return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, R(-220, -560, 440, 560, 6, '#5A6070', 9) + R(-200, -540, 200 - open * 160, 540, 0, 'rgba(230,240,246,0.55)', 4) + R(open * 160, -540, 200 - open * 160, 540, 0, 'rgba(230,240,246,0.55)', 4) + R(-160, -620, 320, 56, 10, '#2C6FB6', 0) + T(0, -582, 'SAÍDA', 34, '#FFFFFF')); }
function cereal(x, y, s, parts = 1) { let g = ''; for (let i = 0; i < parts; i++) g += G(`translate(${(i - (parts - 1) / 2) * 70},0)`, R(-30, -22, 60, 44, 8, '#C98A4B', 5) + Ln(-20, -6, 20, -6, '#8A5A33', 4) + Ln(-20, 8, 20, 8, '#8A5A33', 4)); return G(`translate(${x},${y}) scale(${s})`, g); }
function headCircle(x, y, n, t, a0) { let g = ''; for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const a = i / n * Math.PI * 2; g += G(`translate(${x + Math.cos(a) * 360},${y + Math.sin(a) * 120})`, C(0, 0, 34, '#E8E4F0', 5)); } return g; }
function planeLights(x, y, t, k) { return G(`translate(${x},${y})`, `<g opacity="${k}">` + C(-60, 0, 26 + 6 * Math.sin(t * 6), '#FFF6C8', 0) + C(60, 0, 26 + 6 * Math.sin(t * 6 + 1), '#FFF6C8', 0) + C(-60, 0, 80, 'rgba(255,246,200,0.25)', 0) + C(60, 0, 80, 'rgba(255,246,200,0.25)', 0) + '</g>'); }
function stairs(x, y, k, h = 180) { if (k <= 0) return ''; let g = ''; for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) g += R(-60 - i * 4, -i * (h / 6) * k, 120 + i * 8, 16, 4, '#9AA3AD', 4); return G(`translate(${x},${y})`, Ln(-70, 0, -60, -h * k, '#6A7280', 8) + Ln(70, 0, 60, -h * k, '#6A7280', 8) + g); }
const rp = (d, col, w, op = 1) => `<path d="${d}" fill="none" stroke="${col}" stroke-width="${w}" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="${op}"/>`;
const scF = (bg, g, cam) => sc(bg, ((bg === 'portao' || bg === 'portaoEscuro') ? fogWin(TNOW, bg === 'portaoEscuro') : '') + g, cam);
function fogWin(t, dark) { const id = 'fw' + (ZID++); let g = `<defs><radialGradient id="${id}"><stop offset="0" stop-color="${dark ? '#C8D2DE' : '#F4F7F9'}" stop-opacity="${dark ? 0.55 : 0.85}"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#F4F7F9" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>`; const r = rng(31); for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) { const x = ((r() * 2400 + t * (20 + r() * 30)) % 2600) - 340, y = 200 + r() * 260; g += E(x, y, 380 + r() * 200, 110 + r() * 60, `url(#${id})`, 0); } return g; }
const NEOH = (o) => head(Object.assign(neoAt(AGE), { hs: 1 }, o));

const S = [];
// 0 — gancho: todos os voos cancelados; portão 12
S[0] = (t, d) => { const aP = at(0, /portão/, 0, 0.3);
  let g = board(1300, 400, 0.7, [['10:05', 'LISBOA', 'CANCELADO'], ['10:20', 'RECIFE', 'CANCELADO'], ['10:40', 'TÓQUIO', 'CANCELADO'], ['11:00', 'MIAMI', 'CANCELADO'], ['11:15', 'SALVADOR', 'CANCELADO']], t);
  g += sitPerson(neoAt(AGE), 640, 820, 0.95, { expr: t > aP ? 'worried' : 'neutral', lx: 1 }) + vig(0.5);
  return scF('portao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.12], [960, 540, 1.0])); };
// 1 — a névoa: não se vê nem a asa
S[1] = (t, d) => { let g = fog(t * 1.5, 0.95, -100, 1300, 4) + fog(t, 0.8, 0, 1080, 7) + vig(0.55);
  return sc('pista', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.0], [960, 540, 1.1])); };
// 2 — ninguém sabe quando vai embora; primeiro dia
S[2] = (t, d) => { const aU = at(2, /último/, 0, 0.5);
  let g = NEOS({ x: 960, y: FY + 380, s: 1.6, expr: 'worried' }) + vig(0.6);
  if (t > aU) g += bigTxt(960, 230, pop1(t, aU), 'E NÃO VAI SER', 'O ÚLTIMO', '#FFFFFF', '#FF6A6A', 54, 80);
  return scF('portao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 420, 1.0], [960, 380, 1.12])); };
// 3 — dia 1: aniversário da mãe; cachecol na mochila
S[3] = (t, d) => { const aC = at(3, /cachecol/);
  let g = NEOS({ x: 700, y: FY, expr: 'happy', smile: true, hr: [150, -260], lx: 1 }) + memPanel(1100, 200, 600, 420, pop1(t, 1.2), R(0, 0, 600, 420, 0, '#F6E7C8', 0) + G('translate(300,420) scale(0.55)', person(Object.assign({}, LUCIA, { x: 0, y: 0, s: 1, expr: 'happy' }))) + cake(130, 330, 0.35), 1, 3);
  if (t > aC) g += G(`translate(980,640) scale(${pop1(t, aC)})`, R(-110, -40, 220, 80, 20, '#C62A2A', 6) + Ln(-80, -40, -80, 40, '#E8E4F0', 8) + Ln(-40, -40, -40, 40, '#E8E4F0', 8) + R(60, 40, 50, 70, 10, '#C62A2A', 6));
  return scF('portao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.0], [1000, 520, 1.06])); };
// 4 — o painel fica vermelho: cancelado
S[4] = (t, d) => { const ks = [0, 1, 2].map(n => at(4, /cancelado/, n, 0.2));
  const rows = [['12:00', 'SÃO LUÍS', 'CANCELADO', pop1(t, ks[0])], ['12:30', 'PORTO ALEGRE', 'CANCELADO', pop1(t, ks[1])], ['13:00', 'BUENOS AIRES', 'CANCELADO', pop1(t, ks[2])], ['13:30', 'FORTALEZA', 'CANCELADO', pop1(t, ks[2] + 0.6)], ['14:00', 'MÃE ❤', 'CANCELADO', pop1(t, ks[2] + 1.0)]];
  let g = board(960, 520, 1.15, rows, t) + vig(0.5);
  return sc('saguao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 520, 1.0], [960, 520, 1.08])); };
// 5 — todo mundo reclama
S[5] = (t, d) => { let g = '';
  [[0, 300, 'angry', [220, -330]], [1, 520, 'angry', [200, -300]], [2, 1460, 'tired', null], [3, 1680, 'worried', null]].forEach(([p, x, e, hr]) => { g += pp(PAX[p], { x, y: FY + 10, s: 0.84, sx: x > 960 ? -1 : 1, expr: e, ...(hr ? { hr } : {}) }); });
  g += say(200, 140, 520, 'CADÊ O GERENTE?!', 44, 'left', '#FFFFFF', t, 0.3) + lying(Object.assign({}, PAX[4], { hs: 1, expr: 'sleep' }), 1100, 900, 0.45) + NEOS({ x: 900, y: FY, expr: 'tired' }) + tears(1460, 420, t, 0.5);
  return sc('saguao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.0], [960, 520, 1.05])); };
// 6 — celular sem sinal
S[6] = (t, d) => { let g = NEOS({ x: 640, y: FY, expr: 'worried', hr: [140, -300], lx: 1 }) + phoneChat(1300, 540, 0.95, t, [], 'MÃE', 0) + G(`translate(1300,560) scale(${pop1(t, 1.0)})`, R(-140, -40, 280, 80, 20, '#C62A2A', 0) + T(0, 14, 'SEM SINAL', 36, '#FFFFFF'));
  return scF('portao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.0], [1100, 520, 1.08])); };
// 7 — grava o áudio "eu vou chegar. prometo."
S[7] = (t, d) => { const aF = at(7, /feliz/, 0, 0.1);
  let g = NEOS({ x: 640, y: FY, expr: 'happy', smile: true, hr: [130, -330], lx: 1 }) + phoneChat(1300, 540, 0.95, t, [{ k: pop1(t, aF + 2.5) }], 'MÃE', 0);
  if (t > aF) g += say(160, 150, 620, 'EU VOU CHEGAR. PROMETO.', 42, 'left', '#FFF6C8', t, aF + 1.2);
  return scF('portao', g, [960, 540, 1.0]); };
// 8 — não envia (reloginho)
S[8] = (t, d) => { let g = phoneChat(960, 540, 1.4, t, [{ k: 1 }], 'MÃE', 0) + G(`translate(1250,380) scale(${pop1(t, 1.2)})`, R(-110, -36, 220, 72, 18, '#1A1210', 0) + T(0, 12, 'NÃO ENVIA', 32, '#FFFFFF')) + vig(0.6);
  return scF('portao', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.0], [1060, 440, 1.25])); };
// 9 — dia 2: Guarulhos, 100 mil por dia; ninguém sai
S[9] = (t, d) => { const aC = at(9, /cem/), aN = at(9, /nenhuma/);
  let g = R(-200, -200, 2320, 1480, 0, '#2C3550', 0) + fog(t, 0.6, 0, 1080, 9);
  if (t > aC) { for (let i = 0; i < 60; i++) g += C(260 + (i % 15) * 100, 360 + Math.floor(i / 15) * 100, 26, '#E8E4F0', 4); g += G(`translate(960,240) scale(${pop1(t, aC)})`, T(0, 0, '+100 MIL PESSOAS POR DIA', 64, '#FFE14D', 12)); }
  if (t > aN) g += G(`translate(960,860) scale(${pop1(t, aN)})`, R(-360, -60, 720, 120, 30, '#C62A2A', 7) + T(0, 18, 'NINGUÉM CONSEGUE SAIR', 46, '#FFFFFF'));
  return sc(null, g, [960, 540, 1.0]); };
// 10 — praça de alimentação: pão de queijo e café acabando
S[10] = (t, d) => { const aP = at(10, /pão/), aC = at(10, /café/, 0, 0.1);
  let g = '';
  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) g += pp(PAX[i], { x: 300 + i * 330, y: FY + 20, s: 0.8, sx: i % 2 ? -1 : 1, expr: i % 2 ? 'angry' : 'worried', ...(i % 2 ? { hr: [200, -330] } : {}) });
  if (t > aP) g += badgeB(560, 260, pop1(t, aP + 1.0), 'PÃO DE QUEIJO: ESGOTADO', '#C62A2A', '#FFFFFF', 34, -4);
  if (t > aC) g += badgeB(1360, 260, pop1(t, aC + 0.6), 'CAFÉ: ESGOTADO', '#C62A2A', '#FFFFFF', 34, 4);
  return sc('praca', g, drift(t, d, [960, 540, 1.0], [960, 520, 1.06])); };
// 11 — Mehran Karimi Nasseri: 18 anos no aeroporto de Paris
S[11] = (t, d) => { const aM = at(11, /mehran/), aD = at(11, /dezoito/);
  let g = rays(t, '#1E2A5A', '#3C5A8A');
  if (t > aM) g += memPanel(260, 220, 620, 560, pop1(t, aM), sepia(R(0, 0, 620, 560, 0, '#E8E2D8', 0) + G('translate(310,560) scale(0.62)', person(Object.assign({}, xt({ skin: '#D9A47A', shirt: '#6A5A4A', hair: 'side', hairCol: '#5A5048', stubble: true, old: true, iris: '#3A2A1A' }), { x: 0, y: 0, s: 1, expr: 'neutral' }))) + R(40, 420, 540, 100, 10, '#2C6FB6', 6)), 1, -3) + T(570, 860, 'MEHRAN KARIMI NASSERI', 38, '#FFFFFF', 8);
  if (t > aD) g += G(`translate(1360,420) scale(${pop1(t, aD)})`, T(0, 0, '18 ANOS', 140, '#FFE14D', 18) + T(0, 110, 'NO AEROPORTO DE PARIS', 44, '#FFFFFF', 10) + T(0, 170, '1988 – 2006', 40, '#BFC8DA', 8));
  return sc(null, g, [960, 540, 1.0]); };
